(7598034, 1226945, 87808, '<td valign="top">I recognize those chubby chops!!!</td>', 'I recognize those chubby chops!!!', '2018-10-02 13:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7598035, 1226718, 87808, '<td valign="top">Oh that is a good one, excellent shot, really crisp and clear but showing the speed. I know this is a hard shot to do with the dust, I have been trying all week and coming no where near as excellently done as this.  In my eyes, this is a stunner! 9</td>', 'Oh that is a good one, excellent shot, really crisp and clear but showing the speed. I know this is a hard shot to do with the dust, I have been trying all week and coming no where near as excellently done as this.  In my eyes, this is a stunner! 9', '2018-10-02 13:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7598037, 1226926, 87808, '<td valign="top">Look at that history on the wall!</td>', 'Look at that history on the wall!', '2018-10-02 13:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7598038, 1226875, 87808, '<td valign="top">Everyone and their mother takes shots out of the airplane window.  And they are all the same, boring, mine are even worse when I take them.  Then you see a gem like this and want to carry on taking shots out of a window in the hopes you can get something as stunning as this.  This is splendid!</td>', 'Everyone and their mother takes shots out of the airplane window.  And they are all the same, boring, mine are even worse when I take them.  Then you see a gem like this and want to carry on taking shots out of a window in the hopes you can get something as stunning as this.  This is splendid!', '2018-10-02 13:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7598049, 1226970, 173844, '<td valign="top">Your title certainly nails it.  Looking at it, and going beyond the dark bird spreading its wings, reveals nuanced cues --  the advancing foreground shadows and the innocently serene resting gulls; the water edging in from the right; the search for an ambiguous horizon, which hides among clouds that turn out to be land forms.  Beautiful and cunning, a stellar scene.</td>', 'Your title certainly nails it.  Looking at it, and going beyond the dark bird spreading its wings, reveals nuanced cues --  the advancing foreground shadows and the innocently serene resting gulls; the water edging in from the right; the search for an ambiguous horizon, which hides among clouds that turn out to be land forms.  Beautiful and cunning, a stellar scene.', '2018-10-02 19:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7598050, 1226914, 173844, '<td valign="top">Beautifully composed guinea fowl, and what an apt subject for a black and white image.  You seem to have captured its essence, at least to the extent that we can truly understand him or her.  Perfect fade out of the feathers into the background.  Wonderful portrait.</td>', 'Beautifully composed guinea fowl, and what an apt subject for a black and white image.  You seem to have captured its essence, at least to the extent that we can truly understand him or her.  Perfect fade out of the feathers into the background.  Wonderful portrait.', '2018-10-02 19:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7598052, 1226927, 173844, '<td valign="top">Evocative blue monochrome that, with blurred sea and sky against the meticulous structures, whispers of eternity.  That structure on the right in the deep background secures the composition.  Lovely.</td>', 'Evocative blue monochrome that, with blurred sea and sky against the meticulous structures, whispers of eternity.  That structure on the right in the deep background secures the composition.  Lovely.', '2018-10-02 19:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7598076, 1226881, 23098, '<td valign="top">Great cityscape.</td>', 'Great cityscape.', '2018-10-03 10:01:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7598102, 1226720, 50695, '<td valign="top">Oh my, what is this Posthumous Blue Ribbon doing here? I must reward it immediately.<br/> <br/><a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1077284" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077284.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077284.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077284.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Oh my, what is this Posthumous Blue Ribbon doing here? I must reward it immediately. ', '2018-10-03 18:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7598115, 1226405, 56502, '<td valign="top">I guess it''s just blueberries, but they look HUGE!</td>', 'I guess it''s just blueberries, but they look HUGE!', '2018-10-04 10:02:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7598118, 1226155, 67258, '<td valign="top">Oh, this is gorgeous!<br/> <br/>Back for another visit - I think this is my favourite of the challenge.  Lots of reasons why it <i>could</i> be voted down - a lack of critical sharpness, the lack of eye contact with the viewer, a non-traditional balance to the composition - but these are all things that in this instance enhance the image.  I find it immensely engaging, whilst quite challenging.</td>', 'Oh, this is gorgeous! Back for another visit - I think this is my favourite of the challenge.  Lots of reasons why it could be voted down - a lack of critical sharpness, the lack of eye contact with the viewer, a non-traditional balance to the composition - but these are all things that in this instance enhance the image.  I find it immensely engaging, whilst quite challenging.', '2018-10-04 11:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7598122, 1226770, 87808, '<td valign="top">The little blob of water near it''s neck, looks to me like a helmet, made me laugh!</td>', 'The little blob of water near it''s neck, looks to me like a helmet, made me laugh!', '2018-10-04 14:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7598146, 1226917, 124815, '<td valign="top">Mere chance! Mere chance makes a great image</td>', 'Mere chance! Mere chance makes a great image', '2018-10-04 22:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7598147, 1226956, 124815, '<td valign="top">there is something very appealing about this image</td>', 'there is something very appealing about this image', '2018-10-04 22:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7598194, 1226962, 173844, '<td valign="top">It took a moment or two for my ho-hum first impression to slough off, revealing a charming articulation of light, form, composition, tone, line and rhythm.  This is very, very good, in my opinion, and rewards a patient appraisal.  The woman ascending the staircase deftly enhances the overall elegance.</td>', 'It took a moment or two for my ho-hum first impression to slough off, revealing a charming articulation of light, form, composition, tone, line and rhythm.  This is very, very good, in my opinion, and rewards a patient appraisal.  The woman ascending the staircase deftly enhances the overall elegance.', '2018-10-05 15:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7598195, 1226904, 173844, '<td valign="top">Warm and natural high key portrait of these two friends.  The details are beautifully accomplished.  It can bring one to choke up with pleasure.</td>', 'Warm and natural high key portrait of these two friends.  The details are beautifully accomplished.  It can bring one to choke up with pleasure.', '2018-10-05 15:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
